@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.SiteAdmin.SiteAdmin_UsageToolCalcAssetsModels.SiteAdmin_UsageToolCalcAssetsAddModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider operationalProvider;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.ParentSecureAreaEnum.SiteAdmin.GetDescription()} - {MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.SiteAdmin_UsageToolCalcAssets.GetDescription()} - Add";
}
<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">

        <div class="card p-md-1 mv-gradient">
            @if (Model != null && Model.IsSuccess)
            {
                <div class="card-header">
                    Success!
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    Usage Tool Calc Asset successfully updated
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                    <a href="/operational/SiteAdmin/SiteAdmin_UsageToolCalcAssets" class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>&nbsp;Ok</a>
                </div>

            }
            else
            {
                <div class="card-header">
                    Policy Details:
                </div>
                <form asp-action="SiteAdmin_UsageToolCalcAssets_Add" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                    <div class="card-body">

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="AssetIcon" class="control-label"></label>
                                <br />
                                Search one on <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm" target="_blank" href="https://fontawesome.com/">fontawesome.com</a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <input class="form-control" asp-for="AssetIcon" type="text" />
                                <span asp-validation-for="AssetIcon" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="AssetName" class="control-label"></label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <input class="form-control" asp-for="AssetName" type="text" />
                                <span asp-validation-for="AssetName" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="AverageKWH" class="control-label"></label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <input class="form-control" asp-for="AverageKWH" type="text" />
                                <span asp-validation-for="AverageKWH" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="AssetType" class="control-label"></label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Html.DropDownList("AssetType", Model.AssetType, new { @class = "form-control" })
                                <span asp-validation-for="AssetType" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="card-footer">

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <a href="/operational/SiteAdmin/SiteAdmin_UsageToolCalcAssets" class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i>&nbsp;Back to Policies</a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6 text-right">
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-save"></i>&nbsp;Save Changes</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </form>
            }
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script>
    </script>
}
